 introText:"Wilton Manors drivers know that local traffic on Oakland Park Boulevard, Wilton Drive, and the surrounding streets means constant shifting — which puts significant stress on your transmission. At Vertical Automotive on Oakland Park Blvd, we've been providing expert transmission service for 36 years. Whether you drive an automatic, manual, CVT, dual-clutch, or EV, our ASE-certified technicians use manufacturer-specific diagnostic tools and fluids to service your transmission correctly. A routine transmission fluid exchange is one of the most cost-effective ways to extend your vehicle's life — especially in South Florida's heat, which accelerates fluid breakdown. We also perform complete transmission diagnostics to identify problems early, before they become expensive failures. Our technicians explain every finding and provide written estimates before any work begins. Every transmission service is backed by our 3-year / 36,000-mile warranty — the strongest in Broward County.",
 introTextEs:"Los conductores de Wilton Manors saben que el tráfico local en Oakland Park Boulevard, Wilton Drive y las calles circundantes significa cambios constantes — lo que pone estrés significativo en su transmisión. En Vertical Automotive en Oakland Park Blvd, hemos estado proporcionando servicio experto de transmisión durante 36 años. Ya sea que conduzca un automático, manual, CVT, doble embrague o EV, nuestros técnicos certificados ASE usan herramientas de diagnóstico y fluidos específicos del fabricante para dar servicio a su transmisión correctamente. Un intercambio de fluido de transmisión de rutina es una de las formas más rentables de extender la vida de su vehículo. Cada servicio de transmisión está respaldado por nuestra garantía de 3 años / 36,000 millas.",
