 city:"fort-lauderdale",
 introText:"Regular oil changes are the single most important thing you can do to extend your engine's life — and in Fort Lauderdale's heat, oil breaks down faster than the manufacturer's'normal conditions' schedule assumes. At Vertical Automotive on NE 11th Street, we provide complete engine oil service for conventional, synthetic blend, and full synthetic oils. But we don't just change your oil — every oil service includes a multi-point inspection covering fluid levels, belt condition, tire pressure, brake wear, and a visual check of your vehicle's major systems. We use the correct oil weight and specification for your vehicle (not a one-size-fits-all approach), and we install quality filters that actually protect your engine. For vehicles requiring specialty oils (European long-life, hybrid-specific, or diesel), we stock the correct fluids. Engine air filter replacement and fuel filter service are also available. Every service is backed by our 3-year / 36,000-mile warranty.",
