 faq: [
 { question:"How much does car diagnostics cost in Wilton Manors?", questionEs:"¿Cuánto cuesta el diagnóstico de auto en Wilton Manors?", answer:"At Vertical Automotive in Wilton Manors, complete diagnostic service This includes manufacturer-level scanning, hands-on testing, and a written report. The fee is applied toward your repair if you choose to have the work done here. Call (954) 565-1518 to schedule.", answerEs:"En Vertical Automotive en Wilton Manors. La tarifa se aplica a su reparación si elige hacer el trabajo aquí. Llame al (954) 565-1518 para programar." },
 { question:"My check engine light is on — is it serious?", questionEs:"Mi luz de check engine está encendida — ¿es serio?", answer:"It could be anything from a loose gas cap to a serious engine problem. The only way to know is a proper diagnosis. Don't ignore it — some check engine light causes can lead to expensive damage if left unaddressed (catalytic converter damage from a misfire, for example). A diagnostic now can save thousands later.", answerEs:"Podría ser cualquier cosa desde una tapa de gasolina suelta hasta un problema serio del motor. La única forma de saber es un diagnóstico adecuado. No lo ignore — un diagnóstico de ahora puede ahorrar miles después." },
 { question:"Can you diagnose intermittent problems that come and go?", questionEs:"¿Pueden diagnosticar problemas intermitentes que van y vienen?", answer:"Yes — intermittent problems are our specialty. We check stored and pending codes, freeze frame data (the conditions when the code was set), and can perform extended monitoring if needed. Our 36 years of experience helps us recognize patterns that less experienced shops might miss.", answerEs:"Sí — los problemas intermitentes son nuestra especialidad. Verificamos códigos almacenados y pendientes, datos de cuadro congelado y podemos realizar monitoreo extendido si es necesario." },
 ],
