 introText:"Routine maintenance is the most cost-effective way to keep your vehicle reliable, safe, and running efficiently — and it's especially important in Fort Lauderdale's demanding climate. At Vertical Automotive on NE 11th Street, we provide manufacturer-recommended maintenance services at every mileage interval: 30K service, 60K service, and 90K service. Each service is tailored to your specific vehicle — not a generic checklist. South Florida's heat, humidity, and salt air accelerate wear on fluids, rubber components, cooling systems, and electrical connections. Our ASE-certified technicians follow manufacturer service schedules as a baseline, then adjust for local driving conditions. We'll tell you what's needed now, what's recommended, and what can safely wait — in writing, before any work begins. Regular maintenance prevents expensive breakdowns and preserves your vehicle's resale value. Every maintenance service is backed by our 3-year / 36,000-mile warranty.",
 introTextEs:"El mantenimiento de rutina es la forma más rentable de mantener su vehículo confiable, seguro y funcionando eficientemente — y es especialmente importante en el clima exigente de Fort Lauderdale. En Vertical Automotive en NE 11th Street, proporcionamos servicios de mantenimiento recomendados por el fabricante en cada intervalo de millaje: servicio 30K, servicio 60K y servicio 90K. Cada servicio está adaptado a su vehículo específico — no una lista genérica. Cada servicio de mantenimiento está respaldado por nuestra garantía de 3 años / 36,000 millas.",
